# libretranslate
msgid "**OpenTalk Cross-Launch:** Start a video meeting in OpenTalk from a file context without re-authenticating when ``web-app-opentalk`` is deployed alongside."
msgstr "**OpenTalk Cross-Launch:** Aloita videokokous OpenTalk-palvelussa tiedostokontekstista autentikoimatta uudelleen ``web-app-opentalk`` käytetään rinnakkain."

# libretranslate
