# libretranslate
msgid "**Read-only tool surface:** The sidecar runs with `-r` and `GITEA_READONLY=true`, which hides every write tool. What remains are the read categories `user`, `repository`, `issue`, `pull_request`, `search`, `file`, `branch`, `tag`, `commit` and `release`, pinned through `GITEA_SCOPES`. Making the instance mutate anything through MCP is an explicit operator change to the command line and the token scopes."
