# libretranslate
msgid "Both journeys are covered bespoke in ``files/playwright/playwright.spec.js``, which targets the ``openid-connect/auth`` href explicitly, opens ``/admin``, and signs out at ``/admin/ui/logout``; a second scenario drives the biber-to-administrator mail round-trip across two browser contexts. The path back to the generic personas is a distinguishable login control on Mailu’s SSO page."
msgstr "Molemmat matkat kuuluvat ``files/playwright/playwright.spec.js``, joka koskee ``openid-connect/auth`` href nimenomaisesti, avautuu ``/admin``, ja kirjautua ulos ``/admin/ui/logout``; toinen skenaario ajaa bailer-to-hallinnoija postin kiertomatkan kahden selaimen yhteydessä. Polku takaisin geneerisiin persooniin on erotettavissa oleva kirjautumisohjaus Mailu."

# libretranslate
msgid "Both journeys are covered bespoke in ``files/playwright/playwright.spec.js``: the master-realm super administrator drives the admin console, and the normal-realm administrator and biber each drive the realm account console including sign-out. The path back to the generic personas is an app-shaped surface behind the shared auth chain, which the identity provider by definition does not have."
msgstr "Molemmat matkat kuuluvat ``files/playwright/playwright.spec.js``: Master-realm super ylläpitäjä ajaa admin konsolin, ja normaali-realm ylläpitäjä ja Bilder jokainen ajaa valtakunnan tilin konsoli mukaan lukien kirjautuminen. Polku takaisin geneerisiin persooniin on sovelluksen muotoinen pinta yhteisen auth-ketjun takana, mitä identiteettien tarjoajalla ei määritelmän mukaan ole."

# libretranslate
msgid "Both journeys are covered bespoke in `files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`, which targets the `openid-connect/auth` href explicitly, opens `/admin`, and signs out at `/admin/ui/logout`; a second scenario drives the biber-to-administrator mail round-trip across two browser contexts. The path back to the generic personas is a distinguishable login control on Mailu's SSO page."
