# libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Cross-service probes (biber denied at prometheus, biber denied at matomo, dashboard tile reachability) are NOT part of the per-role biber persona. They live in the provider's own spec (`web-app-{prometheus,matomo,dashboard}/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`), parameterised once over the provider's `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifest. For the dashboard, the parameterised scenario delegates to `web-app-dashboard/files/playwright/dashboard-card-flow.js::runDashboardCardScenario(page, context, target)`, which owns the tile visibility / iframe-embed / \"Tab\" pop-out assertions in one SPOT."
msgstr "Monipalveluanturit (Raamattu kielletty Prometheusissa, Raamattu evätty Matomossa, kojelaudan laattojen saatavuus) EI ole osa per-role bailer persona. He asuvat palveluntarjoajan omassa mittauksessa (`web-app-{prometheus,matomo,dashboard}/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`), parametrit kerran yli palveluntarjoajan `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` luettelo. Kojelauta, parametrinen skenaario delegoi `web-app-dashboard/files/playwright/dashboard-card-flow.js::runDashboardCardScenario(page, context, target)`, joka omistaa laattanäkyvyys / iframe-membed / \"Tab\" Pop-out-väitteitä yhdellä iskulla."

# libretranslate
msgid "Cross-service probes are NOT part of the per-role administrator persona. Dashboard tile reachability is owned by `web-app-dashboard/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`, which delegates the per-target body to the `runDashboardCardScenario` helper in `dashboard-card-flow.js` (tile visible → click loads in `#main iframe` → header \"Tab\" button pops the embed into a fresh browser tab). That helper is the SPOT for dashboard-tile mechanics; consumer specs MUST NOT reimplement any of those assertions. Prometheus admin-reach and scrape parity are owned by `web-app-prometheus/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`. Matomo admin-reach and tracker presence are owned by `web-app-matomo/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`. Each provider parameterises the assertion over its `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifest."
msgstr "Cross-service luotaimet eivät ole osa per-role ylläpitäjä persona. Dashboard laatta saavutettavissa omistaa `web-app-dashboard/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`, joka delegoi kohdetta kohden elimen `runDashboardCardScenario` auttaja `dashboard-card-flow.js` (laatta näkyvissä → napsauta kuormia `#main iframe` → otsikko \"Tab\" painike ponnahtaa upotettavaksi uuteen selainvälilehteen). Tämä apuri on SPOT kojelauta-tiili mekaniikka; kuluttajien specs EI saa toteuttaa mitään näistä väitteistä. Prometheus admin-reach ja crape pariteetti omistaa `web-app-prometheus/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`. Matomo admin-reach ja tracker läsnäolo omistaa `web-app-matomo/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`. Jokainen palveluntarjoaja parametrisoi väitteensä sen `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` luettelo."

# libretranslate
msgid "Cross-service surface assertions (dashboard tile reachability, prometheus admin-reach and scrape parity, matomo admin-reach and tracker presence, biber-denied-at-prometheus, biber-denied-at-matomo) are owned by the provider's own spec. Each provider parameterises the assertion over its `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifest, rendered via `lookup('roles_with_service', '<svc>')`. Consumer roles' personas MUST NOT duplicate these probes."
msgstr "Cross-service-pinnoitteet (kojelauta laatan tavoittavuus, prometheus admin-reach ja naarmuuntuvuus, matomo admin-reach ja tracker läsnäolo, baider-dened-at-prometheus, baider-dened-at-matomo) ovat palveluntarjoajan omien varojen omistuksessa. Jokainen tarjoaja parametrisee väitteen `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifesti, renderöity kautta `lookup('roles_with_service', '<svc>')`. Kuluttajaroolien henkilö ei saa kopioida näitä luotaimia."

