# libretranslate
msgid "Swarm attaches every task to `docker_gwbridge` for ingress and egress. A sidecar isolation check that compares attached addresses against the provider's declared subnets MUST accept that interface, or it rejects every sidecar in swarm while proving nothing about application reachability."
