# libretranslate
msgid "Taiga redirects `/` to the public `/discover` showcase, which renders a bare Login link but not the OIDC entry point; only `/login` binds the SSO directive (see the note in [`files/playwright/_shared.js`](./files/playwright/_shared.js)). The shared personas always enter at the site root, so they can never reach Taiga's SSO button. Taiga's AngularJS shell additionally exposes logout only through `ng-click` / `tg-nav` / `ui-sref` directives, which the generic in-app logout helper cannot activate. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) therefore declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`; the equivalent journeys are driven by the role-local `test-login-oidc.js` and `test-login-native.js` specs, which enter at `/login` and log out through Taiga's own control."
msgstr "Taiga ohjaa `/` yleisölle `/discover` showcase, joka tekee paljaasta Login-linkistä mutta ei OIDC-tulopisteestä; ainoastaan `/login` sitoo SSO-direktiivin (Katso viestistä [`files/playwright/_shared.js`](./files/playwright/_shared.js)). Jaetut persoonat tulevat aina sivuston juurille, joten he eivät koskaan pääse TaigaSe on SSO-nappi. Taigan AngularJS-tulkki paljastaa lisäksi kirjautumisen vain läpi `ng-click` / `tg-nav` / `ui-sref` direktiivit, joita yleinen sisäänkirjautumisapulainen ei voi aktivoida. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) siis ilmoittaa `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` sekä `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`; vastaavia matkoja ohjaa paikallinen rooli `test-login-oidc.js` sekä `test-login-native.js` @ info: whatsthis `/login` ja kirjaudu ulos TaigaOman hallinnan."

# libretranslate
msgid "Taiga redirects ``/`` to the public ``/discover`` showcase, which renders a bare Login link but not the OIDC entry point; only ``/login`` binds the SSO directive (see the note in ```files/playwright/_shared.js`` <./files/playwright/_shared.js>`__). The shared personas always enter at the site root, so they can never reach Taiga’s SSO button. Taiga’s AngularJS shell additionally exposes logout only through ``ng-click`` / ``tg-nav`` / ``ui-sref`` directives, which the generic in-app logout helper cannot activate. ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ therefore declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`` and ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true``; the equivalent journeys are driven by the role-local ``test-login-oidc.js`` and ``test-login-native.js`` specs, which enter at ``/login`` and log out through Taiga’s own control."
msgstr "Taiga ohjaa ``/`` yleisölle ``/discover`` showcase, joka tekee paljaasta Login-linkistä mutta ei OIDC-tulopisteestä; ainoastaan ``/login`` sitoo SSO-direktiivin (Katso viestistä ```files/playwright/_shared.js`` <./files/playwright/_shared.js>`__). The shared personas always enter at the site root, so they can never reach Taiga’s SSO button. Taiga’s AngularJS shell additionally exposes logout only through ``ng-click`` / ``tg-nav`` / ``ui-sref`` directives, which the generic in-app logout helper cannot activate. ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ therefore declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`` and ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true``; the equivalent journeys are driven by the role-local ``test-login-oidc.js`` and ``test-login-native.js`` specs, which enter at ``/login`` ja kirjaudu ulos Taiga- Oman hallinnan."

