# libretranslate
msgid "The role installs a systemd unit that snapshots each configured source directory into `<backups>/<machine-hash>/backup-secrets-to-local/<generation>/files/<name>`, hard-linked against the previous generation. Optional sources are skipped when absent (the CA in Let's Encrypt mode, ACME/certbot in self-signed mode). The generation joins the same backup tree the pull and device roles consume, so it flows to the backup host and the encrypted device automatically."
msgstr "Rooli asentaa järjestelmällisen yksikön, joka kuvaa jokaisen konfiguroidun lähdehakemiston `<backups>/<machine-hash>/backup-secrets-to-local/<generation>/files/<name>`, vaikeasti yhdistetty edelliseen sukupolveen. Valinnaiset lähteet jätetään huomiotta poissa ollessa (CA Let's Encrypt -tilassa, ACME/certbot itsekirjoitetussa tilassa). Sukupolven liittyy sama varmuuskopio puu vedon ja laitteen roolit kuluttaa, joten se virtaa varmuuskopion isäntä ja salattu laite automaattisesti."

# libretranslate
msgid "The role installs a systemd unit that snapshots each configured source directory into ``<backups>/<machine-hash>/backup-secrets-to-local/<generation>/files/<name>``, hard-linked against the previous generation. Optional sources are skipped when absent (the CA in Let’s Encrypt mode, ACME/certbot in self-signed mode). The generation joins the same backup tree the pull and device roles consume, so it flows to the backup host and the encrypted device automatically."
