# libretranslate
msgid "There is no standalone `make` target for Playwright. Tests run as part of local deploy flows (e.g. `make compose-deploy mode=reinstall apps=web-app-matomo full_cycle=true`). For spec-only iteration after the first successful deploy, see [Playwright Spec Loop](../../../agents/action/iteration/playwright.md)."
msgstr "Ei ole mitään erillistä `make` Playwrightin kohde. Testit suoritetaan osana paikallisia käyttövirtoja (esim. `make compose-deploy mode=reinstall apps=web-app-matomo full_cycle=true`). For spec vain iteration jälkeen ensimmäisen onnistuneen käyttöönoton, katso [Playwright Spec Loop](../../../agents/action/iteration/playwright.md)."

