msgid "pgAdmin is the most popular and feature‑rich open source administration and development platform for PostgreSQL. This deployment provides a secure, containerized pgAdmin instance complete with optional OAuth2 proxy support for enhanced authentication. It is built for both developers and database administrators who want an easy‐to‐use web interface to manage multiple PostgreSQL servers."
